  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Privacy_Diagnostic_Data_Header\Title:
    Candidate Language=PA-IN: ਡਾਇਗਨੋਸਟਿਕ ਡੇਟਾ
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Privacy_Diagnostic_Data_Header\Subtitle:
