  \SystemSettings\Resources\CorpDeviceManagementDialogLaunchButtonAccessibility\[using:Windows.UI.Xaml.Automation]AutomationProperties\Name:
    Candidate Language=PA-IN: ਕਨੈਕਟ ਕਰੋ
  \SystemSettings\Resources\CorpDeviceManagementDialogErrorButton\Content:
